// OilRig APT Registry Persistence | T1053.005, T1071.004, T1112, T1543.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/OilRig/registry_event_apt_oilrig_mar18.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where ends_with(registry.path, "SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\UMe") or ends_with(registry.path, "SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\UT")
